<%#
# Key: output/format/tool_call
# Purpose: Plain-text tool-call transcript.
# Used: Sent in place of a native tool-call block when a provider request cannot carry it natively, such as a
#   context summary request without tools or a call to a Tool the request does not declare.
# Locals:
# - name: Name of the Tool the model called.
# - id: Provider call identifier that the matching tool-result transcript repeats.
# - input: JSON-encoded Tool input.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
# - This output is embedded inside a larger model-visible message.
# - Keep the wording consistent with output/format/tool_result so calls and results pair up.
-%>
[Tool call <%= name %> (id: <%= id %>)]
Input: <%= input %>
